<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Almanij 1996 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Belgian Almanij 1996 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996</p>
<p>(in billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (excludes minorities)     7.1  vs     6.1</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		 240    vs   215</p>
<p>Note - Almanij, a Belgian holding company, is the leading shareholder of major Belgian Kredietbank NV.  </p>
<p>    Own funds				  14.2  vs  13.6</p>
<p>    Cons balance sheet total	    114.1, up  16.6</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
